name: Audited finite planning and readable protected allowance capacity
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/finite_policy.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed @TMP_HOME
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/allowance_controls.py @TMP_TARGET @ART before
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 SETUP · READY THE MAP RUN | pending-setup
expect-not: Map ✓
submit: setup
require-live-snap: 30 SETUP · READY THE MAP RUN | setup-still-needed
expect-not: Map ✓
ask: Do completed drafting, approval and inspection receipts leave genuine Map acceptance and all investigation work uncreated?
paste-file: @ART/read-command.txt
keys: Enter
wait: 0.5
submit: logs
keys: End
require-live-snap: 25 Calls available for context, scopes, scans and lessons: 2 | allowance-status
expect: protected review remaining: 1
expect: dollar ceiling: not enforced
nav-mode:
keys: z
require-live-snap: 20 READ TRANSCRIPT | reader
resize: 160x48
live-snap: allowance-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: allowance-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: allowance-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: allowance-60x20
resize: 40x12
live-snap: allowance-40x12
keys: End
live-snap: allowance-tail-40x12
keys: PPage
live-snap: allowance-page-1-40x12
keys: PPage
live-snap: allowance-page-2-40x12
keys: PPage
live-snap: allowance-page-3-40x12
keys: PPage
live-snap: allowance-page-4-40x12
keys: PPage
live-snap: allowance-page-5-40x12
ask: Can the exact fixed plan, two available calls, one protected Review call, unknown dollar charges and unavailable legacy run evidence be read at every size without implying new jobs or model requests?
keys: q
resize: 120x36
submit: setup
require-live-snap: 25 SETUP · READY THE MAP RUN | setup-after-read
expect-not: Map ✓
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/allowance_controls.py @TMP_TARGET @ART after
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 SETUP · READY THE MAP RUN | restarted-pending-setup
expect-not: Map ✓
submit: setup
require-live-snap: 30 SETUP · READY THE MAP RUN | restarted-setup
expect-not: Map ✓
paste-file: @ART/read-command.txt
keys: Enter
wait: 0.5
submit: logs
keys: End
require-live-snap: 25 Calls available for context, scopes, scans and lessons: 2 | restarted-allowance
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/allowance_controls.py @TMP_TARGET @ART after
ask: Does no-color restart retain the exact allowance and protected capacity while observations, reservations, attempts and decisions remain zero?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
